00:00:44.790 --> 00:00:49.110
Today I have a special spicy guest.

00:00:49.110 --> 00:00:49.943
- Hello

00:00:49.943 --> 00:00:51.510
- Hi!

00:00:51.510 --> 00:00:52.343
- You guys.

