00:00:55.890 --> 00:00:58.290
Thank you so much for blessing
me with your presence.

00:00:58.290 --> 00:00:59.430
- Thank you for having me.

00:00:59.430 --> 00:01:01.800
- [Tway And Jing] Happy Holidays.

