00:01:07.860 --> 00:01:08.693
- Yeah.

00:01:08.693 --> 00:01:10.242
- but I'm gonna lean sweet today.

00:01:10.242 --> 00:01:11.075
- Oh?

00:01:11.075 --> 00:01:14.610
- I think it's everyone's
favorite dessert for the holidays.

00:01:14.610 --> 00:01:17.043
It is a cinnamon roll.

00:01:17.940 --> 00:01:19.710
- You want me to make it big?

00:01:19.710 --> 00:01:20.543
- I do.

00:01:20.543 --> 00:01:23.437
I want you to make the
world's biggest cinnamon roll.

00:01:23.437 --> 00:01:24.270
- Oh my gosh.

00:01:24.270 --> 00:01:26.820
- [Jing] The icing to dough
ratio needs to be on point.

00:01:26.820 --> 00:01:27.653
- [Tway] Okay.

00:01:27.653 --> 00:01:28.530
