of the cinnamon roll.

00:04:34.230 --> 00:04:38.010
So I have the basics here,
the butter and the brown sugar

00:04:38.010 --> 00:04:40.920
A lot of butter.

00:04:40.920 --> 00:04:42.300
Brown sugar here.

00:04:42.300 --> 00:04:44.250
And you can just like stop here.

00:04:44.250 --> 00:04:46.560
But like, I want to make this special

00:04:46.560 --> 00:04:50.370
for Jing because I love Jing.

00:04:50.370 --> 00:04:52.980
So I have all these spices here for her.

00:04:52.980 --> 00:04:54.750
