00:05:02.190 --> 00:05:05.850
I love that all these spices
are the spices to make pho,

00:05:05.850 --> 00:05:09.030
but we're making cinnamon rolls.

00:05:09.030 --> 00:05:11.310
Imagine a pho cinnamon roll.

00:05:11.310 --> 00:05:12.810
I don't know if that sounds good,

00:05:12.810 --> 00:05:14.640
but like it's a possibility

00:05:14.640 --> 00:05:18.663
if it shares the same ingredients. Right?

00:05:22.620 --> 00:05:23.762
There you go.

00:05:23.762 --> 00:05:25.923
Oh man. What a big boy.

00:05:27.690 --> 00:05:31.491
